#
# A give-up that states its reason but no declarer. The declarer (wasAttributedTo) is
# the only missing required path.
@prefix ex: <https://example.org/trace-finality-counter/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .

ex:lost a gmeow:TraceMarksGivenUp ;
    gmeow:givenUpReason "Marks held only in memory were lost when the service restarted."@en .
